        "description": "Your wedding deserves a setting that feels as special as the moment itself. At Kimpton Cottonwood Hotel, an AAA Four Diamond, 1916 landmark in Omaha’s Blackstone District, your celebration unfolds in beautifully designed spaces, with thoughtful details and a team that takes care of everything behind the scenes.\r\n\r\nFor a limited time, enjoy waived room rental for qualifying Friday and Sunday weddings in 2026.\r\n\r\nWays We Make It Effortless:\r\n-Waived room rental for your ceremony and/or reception\r\n-Dedicated event manager for coordinating venue details\r\n-A complimentary group tasting to bring your menu to life\r\n-Preferred pricing on room blocks for your guests\r\n-Exclusive access for photography opportunities\r\n\r\nFriday & Sunday Weddings | September&#8211;December 2026\r\n\r\nRoom rental waiver applies to Friday and Sunday weddings booked and held between September and December 2026 with a minimum food and beverage spend of $10,000. Ceremony, reception, and combination events qualify. Cannot be combined with other promotional offers. Blackout dates apply. Subject to availability.",
